<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">With that caveat in mind, Table <a href="#S5.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Cosine baseline caveat. ‣ 5.2 Catching mistakes before they happen ‣ 5 Discussion ‣ Tool Calling is Linearly Readable and Steerable in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> reports the actual generation-vs-readout numbers on BFCL.</p>
</div>
