<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 21: </span>Steering strength calibration. “Trans.” = <math id="A17.T21.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> at 50% accuracy. 4B+ IT models transition sharply at <math id="A17.T21.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{\approx}0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{\approx}0.7</annotation></semantics></math>; base models are flat or collapse at high <math id="A17.T21.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A18" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A.18 </span>Cross-layer divergence and attention</h2>

<figure id="A18.F16" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A18.F16.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"><img src="2605.07990v1/fig_divergence.png" id="A18.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/281;" width="476" height="281" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>Cross-tool divergence by layer depth. Divergence rises sharply in the final 20–30% of layers. Steering fails below the inflection point.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A18.F16.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"><img src="2605.07990v1/fig5_attention.png" id="A18.F16.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/205;" width="476" height="205" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>Attention from output position to prompt tokens (Gemma 3 4B). Tool-name and entity tokens receive increasing attention at deeper layers.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
<section id="A18.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Cross-source tool subspace</h3>

<figure id="A18.F17" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2605.07990v1/fig_combined_pca.svg" id="A18.F17.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/513;" width="476" height="513"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>3D PCA of 39 tools from 3 sources (15 synthetic, 14 <math id="A18.F17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-bench airline, 10 ToolBench) in Gemma 3 4B. All tools share the same low-dimensional subspace regardless of source, suggesting linearity extends to real-world APIs.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A18.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Linearity interpolation (all pairs)</h3>

<figure id="A18.F18" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2605.07990v1/fig_linearity_all.svg" id="A18.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/371;" width="476" height="371"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 18: </span>Linearity interpolation for all 4 tested tool pairs. In every case, cosine similarity changes smoothly and the prediction flips sharply at <math id="A18.F18.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{\approx}0.6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{\approx}0.6</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A18.F18.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.7</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.7</annotation></semantics></math>, consistent with linear tool selection across diverse tool combinations.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A19" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A.19 </span>Developer tool steering</h2>

<div id="A19.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A19.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also test on software development tools (10 tools like <span id="A19.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">create_file</span>, <span id="A19.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">run_tests</span>, <span id="A19.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">git_commit</span>, <span id="A19.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">deploy</span>, etc.), which share much more semantic overlap than the primary 15-tool set. Gemma 3 4B gets 63% here, lower than the 73–87% on general tools, which makes sense given the overlap.</p>
</div>
<div id="A19.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A19.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="76.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 76.52" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,76.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D0D7DE;" fill="#D0D7DE" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.84 L 0 71.68 C 0 74.35 2.17 76.52 4.84 76.52 L 648.31 76.52 C 650.98 76.52 653.15 74.35 653.15 71.68 L 653.15 4.84 C 653.15 2.17 650.98 0 648.31 0 L 4.84 0 C 2.17 0 0 2.17 0 4.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F6F8FA;" fill="#F6F8FA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.84 L 0.69 71.68 C 0.69 73.97 2.55 75.83 4.84 75.83 L 648.31 75.83 C 650.6 75.83 652.46 73.97 652.46 71.68 L 652.46 4.84 C 652.46 2.55 650.6 0.69 648.31 0.69 L 4.84 0.69 C 2.55 0.69 0.69 2.55 0.69 4.84 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.78 10.86)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:43.74em;--ltx-fo-height:4.21em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="61.73" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 58.27)" width="605.24"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A19.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:43.74em;">
<span id="A19.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A19.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#6E7781;">Original:<span id="A19.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#24292F;"> {"tool": "create_file", "path": "src/config.yaml", "content": …}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A19.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1A7F37;">Steered:<span id="A19.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">0</span></span></span> {"tool": "run_tests", "suite": "unit", "path": "src/"}
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A19.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A19.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="76.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 76.52" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,76.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D0D7DE;" fill="#D0D7DE" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.84 L 0 71.68 C 0 74.35 2.17 76.52 4.84 76.52 L 648.31 76.52 C 650.98 76.52 653.15 74.35 653.15 71.68 L 653.15 4.84 C 653.15 2.17 650.98 0 648.31 0 L 4.84 0 C 2.17 0 0 2.17 0 4.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F6F8FA;" fill="#F6F8FA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.84 L 0.69 71.68 C 0.69 73.97 2.55 75.83 4.84 75.83 L 648.31 75.83 C 650.6 75.83 652.46 73.97 652.46 71.68 L 652.46 4.84 C 652.46 2.55 650.6 0.69 648.31 0.69 L 4.84 0.69 C 2.55 0.69 0.69 2.55 0.69 4.84 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.78 10.86)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:43.74em;--ltx-fo-height:4.21em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="61.73" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 58.27)" width="605.24"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A19.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:43.74em;">
<span id="A19.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A19.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#6E7781;">Original:<span id="A19.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#24292F;"> {"tool": "deploy", "environment": "staging", "version": …}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A19.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1A7F37;">Steered:<span id="A19.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">0</span></span></span> {"tool": "git_commit", "message": "Deploy staging v2.1"}
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A19.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A19.p4.1" class="ltx_p">PCA top-5 variance is 82.0% (vs. 67.5% for general tools) and top-9 hits 100%, meaning the developer tools are packed into an even smaller subspace. The takeaway: the more semantically similar the tools, the harder they are to steer apart.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A20" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A.20 </span>Full confidence intervals</h2>

<figure id="A20.T22" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A20.T22.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:185.7pt;vertical-align:-89.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(25.8pt,-13.9pt) scale(1.17564628406325,1.17564628406325) ;">
<table id="A20.T22.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A20.T22.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<th id="A20.T22.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="A20.T22.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">Model</span></th>
